559 0 obj
<<
/Title (In order to select the value of m, we use grid search, selecting a value of m from the set [1.1 - 2.2] by running the algorithm across a grid and choosing the solution that minimizes XB and maximizes FS. When the two criteria disagree, we prioritize the lower XB, as it is directly aligned with the objective optimized by FCPCA.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 556 0 R
/Prev 558 0 R
>>
